            P("Super admins can limit how much a space's repositories store, in the space's **Settings** under **Storage quota**: the quota (GB or TB) and when to warn (80% by default). Uploads that would go over the quota are refused. Everyone who can see the space finds its usage on the **Overview**, with a warning when it's nearly or completely full."),
            P("A new space starts with the installation's default quota, 50 GB unless a super admin changed it under **Settings → Repositories**, where it can also be set to no limit. Whoever creates the space can give it another quota, or none, in the create form. Changing the default affects only spaces created afterwards; existing spaces keep their quota, or have none."),
